sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Tech as Lab Technician
    actor Mgr as Lab Manager
    participant Sys as System / API
    actor Eng as ULMD Tech Engineer
    actor Dir as ULMD Supervisor

    Note over Tech, Dir: Corrective Maintenance Workflow
    Tech->>Sys: Scan QR Code on defective equipment
    Sys-->>Tech: Display Asset Passport & Quick Actions
    Tech->>Sys: Submit Fault Report (Severity, Symptoms, Category)
    Sys->>Sys: Set Asset Condition: NEEDS_MAINTENANCE / DEFECTIVE
    Sys->>Sys: Create Work Order (WO-YYYY-XXXX)
    Sys-->>Dir: Notify Open Ticket in Dispatch Queue
    Dir->>Sys: Assign Work Order to Tech Engineer
    Sys-->>Eng: Alert Assigned Work Order
    Eng->>Sys: Accept Ticket (Status: IN_PROGRESS)
    Eng->>Eng: Perform Diagnostic & Physical Repair in Laboratory
    Eng->>Sys: Submit Maintenance Log (Actions, Parts, Hours, Outcome)
    Eng->>Sys: Set Work Order Status: RESOLVED
    Sys-->>Mgr: Request Verification & Operational Test Run
    Mgr->>Sys: Confirm Functionality & Sign Off
    Sys->>Sys: Set Work Order Status: CLOSED
    Sys->>Sys: Set Asset Condition: OPERATIONAL
    Sys->>Sys: Append Immutable Audit Record

    Note over Mgr, Dir: Dual-Authorization Transfer Workflow
    Mgr->>Sys: Initiate Transfer (Asset ID, Target Lab, Justification)
    Sys->>Sys: Set Transfer Status: PENDING_RECEIVER
    Sys->>Sys: Set Asset Condition: TRANSFER_PENDING
    Sys-->>Sys: Alert Destination Lab Manager
    Sys->>Sys: Destination Manager Inspects & Accepts
    Sys->>Sys: Set Transfer Status: PENDING_ULMD
    Dir->>Sys: Review & Approve Relocation
    Sys->>Sys: Update Asset Foreign Keys (laboratory_id, room_id)
    Sys->>Sys: Set Transfer Status: COMPLETED
    Sys->>Sys: Restore Asset Condition: OPERATIONAL
    Sys->>Sys: Write Location History & Audit Record
